WEBVTT

00:31:55.954 --> 00:32:02.579
I'm not entirely sure in in terms of what
it has given me in terms of my ambition

00:32:02.579 --> 00:32:07.163
or my creativity or even just
my sense of the world.

00:32:07.163 --> 00:32:11.871
But I also deeply, deeply
regret the pain that

00:32:11.871 --> 00:32:15.038
I caused others with my own
self destructiveness.

00:32:15.038 --> 00:32:17.579
And one of the biggest
regrets that I have.

00:32:17.579 --> 00:32:22.663
You know what what I put other people
through in that journey to be who I am

00:32:22.663 --> 00:32:26.996
and where I am now. But I also know that

00:32:26.996 --> 00:32:31.329
I couldn't have survived in many ways
without that destructiveness